# Copy to .env.local (covered by this repo's `*.local` .gitignore pattern)
# to point the app at a self-hosted routing/POI backend instead of the public
# demo servers navigation.js falls back to when these are unset.
# See Navigation.md's "Known gaps" for exactly why the public servers
# (router.project-osrm.org, overpass-api.de) aren't production-safe.

# Base URL for OSRM's /route/v1/driving endpoint, including the profile segment.
# VITE_OSRM_BASE=https://your-osrm-instance.example.com/route/v1/driving

# Base URL for an Overpass API interpreter endpoint.
# VITE_OVERPASS_BASE=https://your-overpass-instance.example.com/api/interpreter
